{
 "id": "vci.oidf.dpop-binding.001",
 "description": "The DPoP-bound immediate issuance, the wire shape the OIDF certification suite validated: the DPoP proof on the token request, the DPoP scheme with a fresh ath-bound proof on the credential request, the 1.0 proofs object ({\"jwt\": [proof]}), the proof header's public JWK from the signing-key ask, and the sender-constrained notification.",
 "provenance": "oidf",
 "generator": {
  "repo": "sirosfoundation/siros-wallet-core",
  "commit": "09ab930b4d8f0565ec75bdcd102f28c427ba1ea1",
  "date": "2026-11-04"
 },
 "spec_refs": [
  "RFC 9449 section 4.3 (the access token is sent with the DPoP scheme and a fresh proof)",
  "RFC 9449 section 4.2 (the proof's htm, htu, iat, ath and the public JWK in the header)",
  "OpenID4VCI 1.0 section 7.5 (the proofs parameter: an object keyed by proof type, the array of JWTs)",
  "OpenID4VCI 1.0 section 7.5.1 (exactly one of jwk, kid or x5c identifies the proof's key)",
  "RFC 7638 section 3.2 (the kid is the JWK thumbprint)",
  "OpenID4VCI 1.0 section 11.1 (the notification echoes the credential response's notification_id)"
 ],
 "setup": {
  "time": 1700000000,
  "entropy_seed": 42,
  "pdp": {
   "trusted": true,
   "decision": "in the registry"
  }
 },
 "script": [
  {
   "wmp_in": {
    "method": "wmp.flow.start",
    "params": {
     "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
     "flow_type": "oid4vci",
     "params": {
      "credential_issuer": "https://issuer.example",
      "credential_configuration_ids": [
       "UniversityDegree"
      ],
      "grants": {
       "urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:pre-authorized_code": {
        "pre-authorized_code": "preauth-code-oidf-001"
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "http_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "GET",
     "url": "https://issuer.example/.well-known/openid-credential-issuer",
     "purpose": "IssuerMetadata"
    },
    "reply": {
     "status": 200,
     "content_type": "application/json",
     "body": {
      "credential_issuer": "https://issuer.example",
      "authorization_servers": [
       "https://as.example"
      ],
      "credential_configurations_supported": {
       "UniversityDegree": {
        "scope": "openid"
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "http_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "GET",
     "url": "https://as.example/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server",
     "purpose": "AsMetadata"
    },
    "reply": {
     "status": 200,
     "body": {
      "issuer": "https://as.example",
      "token_endpoint": "https://as.example/token"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "http_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "POST",
     "url": "https://as.example/token",
     "purpose": "Token",
     "headers": {
      "DPoP": "*"
     },
     "form": {
      "grant_type": "urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:pre-authorized_code",
      "pre-authorized_code": "preauth-code-oidf-001"
     }
    },
    "reply": {
     "status": 200,
     "body": {
      "access_token": "at-oidf-dpop-001",
      "token_type": "DPoP",
      "c_nonce": "nonce-oidf-dpop-001"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "host_ask": {
    "expect": {
     "kind": "signing_key"
    },
    "answer": {
     "value": {
      "jwk": {
       "kty": "EC",
       "crv": "P-256",
       "x": "ktT77AqMntawPyU772lBg8nd7cwENrYyOL_KWbYN8Jc",
       "y": "67lPXEq5gJdimDYD0AacxLfRfIm2-fSNd3HBqyXXvBI"
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "host_ask": {
    "expect": {
     "kind": "sign"
    },
    "answer": {
     "value": {
      "signature": [
       1,
       2,
       3,
       4
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "http_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "POST",
     "url": "https://issuer.example/credential",
     "purpose": "Credential",
     "headers": {
      "authorization": "DPoP at-oidf-dpop-001",
      "DPoP": "*"
     },
     "json": {
      "credential_configuration_id": "UniversityDegree",
      "proofs": {
       "jwt": [
        "*"
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    "reply": {
     "status": 200,
     "body": {
      "credential": "credential-jwt-oidf-dpop-001",
      "notification_id": "notif-oidf-dpop-001"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "http_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "POST",
     "url": "https://issuer.example/notification",
     "purpose": "Notification",
     "headers": {
      "authorization": "DPoP at-oidf-dpop-001",
      "DPoP": "*"
     },
     "json": {
      "notification_id": "notif-oidf-dpop-001",
      "event": "credential_accepted"
     }
    },
    "reply": {
     "status": 200,
     "body": {}
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "parsing_offer"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "offer_parsed",
      "payload": {
       "credential_issuer": "https://issuer.example",
       "credential_configuration_ids": [
        "UniversityDegree"
       ]
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "fetching_metadata"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "metadata_fetched"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "as_discovered"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "evaluating_trust"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "trust_evaluated"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "exchanging_token"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "token_obtained"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "requesting_credential"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "step": "credential_received"
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "wmp_out": {
    "expect": {
     "method": "wmp.flow.complete",
     "params": {
      "flow_id": "flow-oidf-dpop-001",
      "result": {
       "credential": "credential-jwt-oidf-dpop-001"
      }
     }
    }
   }
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Backed by the OIDF conformance suite result: plan oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-plan, alias siros-wallet-vci-test, suite 5.3.4, module oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-credential-issuance PASSED on 2026-11-04 (plan detail: https://localhost.emobix.co.uk:8443/plan-detail.html?log=465soSg8t5Gft). The signing-key ask's JWK is embedded in the proof header with its RFC 7638 thumbprint as the kid \u2014 the only key identification (the suite rejects more than one of jwk/kid/x5c)."
}